.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt MUSTACHE-ADA 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mustache-ada
.Nd a small, strict Mustache-subset template engine for code generation
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -offset indent
with Mustache;
.Ed
.Pp
In a GNAT project file the library is selected with
.Ql with "mustache";
.
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
renders a template \(em text with
.Ql {{...}}
tags \(em against a
.Em context :
a stack of scopes, each a tree of
.Sy Scalar ,
.Sy List
and
.Sy Map
values.
It is the engine that turns a grammar's abstract tree into the target
language's syntax, so an emitter never hardcodes a keyword.
.Pp
The subset is strict and aimed at code generation, not HTML:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic {{var}}
Print the scalar
.Ar var .
An unfilled or non-scalar name raises
.Vt Template_Error .
.It Ic {{.}}
The current element of a
.Ic {{#each}}
over scalars.
.It Ic {{#each var}} ... {{/each}}
Iterate a list; each element is pushed as a scope.
.It Ic {{#var}} ... {{/var}}
Section: a list iterates, a map is pushed once, a non-empty scalar renders
once.
.It Ic {{^var}} ... {{/var}}
Inverted: render iff
.Ar var
is absent or empty.
.It Ic {{> partial}}
Include another loaded template, with the same stack.
.El
.Pp
Unlike Mustache, there is no HTML escaping
.Pq Ic {{var}}
is always raw,
and errors are loud rather than silent: an unfilled name raises, it does
not render empty.
.Sh VALUES
A
.Vt Mustache.Value
is a discriminated record in one of three kinds:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Sy Scalar
A string, built with
.Fn New_Scalar Ar text .
.It Sy List
A list of values, built with
.Fn New_List
and grown with
.Fn Append Ar list Ar item .
.It Sy Map
A set of named values, built with
.Fn New_Map
and grown with
.Fn Insert Ar map Ar key Ar item .
Binding a key already present raises
.Vt Template_Error .
.El
.Pp
The builders return a
.Vt Mustache.Value_Access
.Pq a pointer to a heap value ,
so a context is a tree the caller drops when done; nothing is deallocated.
.Sh CONTEXT AND RENDERING
.Fn New_Context Ar root
wraps a root value as a one-scope
.Vt Mustache.Context ;
.Fn Push
and
.Fn Pop
stack scopes for
.Ic {{#each}}
and partials.
.Fn Render Ar name Ar ctx
renders a template previously loaded by
.Fn Load Ar dir
.Pq keyed by base name, without the
.Ql .tmpl
suffix ;
.Fn Render_Text Ar source Ar ctx
renders a template given as a raw string.
.Sh ERRORS
.Vt Mustache.Template_Error
is raised for a missing template, an unfilled or non-scalar
.Ic {{var}} ,
a
.Ic {{#each}}
over a non-list, an unterminated section, an unmatched closing tag, and a
key bound twice.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Root : constant Mustache.Value_Access := Mustache.New_Map;
Item : constant Mustache.Value_Access := Mustache.New_List;
Mustache.Insert (Root, "name", Mustache.New_Scalar ("foo"));
Mustache.Append (Item, Mustache.New_Scalar ("alpha"));
Mustache.Insert (Root, "items", Item);
Ctx : Mustache.Context := Mustache.New_Context (Root);

Mustache.Load ("templates");
Put (Mustache.Render ("struct", Ctx));
Put (Mustache.Render_Text ("{{name}}", Ctx));
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr gprbuild 1
